# This repo has three independent services, each with its own env file:
#
#   backend/.env.example      Node/Express backend (MongoDB, JWT, mail, AI_SERVICE_URL, ...)
#   frontend/.env.example     Vite frontend (VITE_API_BASE_URL, ...)
#   ai-service/.env.example   Python/FastAPI AI microservice (APP_PORT, ...)
#
# Copy each to a sibling `.env` in the same folder and adjust for your
# environment — there is no single shared .env at the repo root.
